subject: fix(cli): log SQLite/tray runtime self-heal failures instead of swallowing

Empty catch blocks at cli.js:85,88 silently swallowed ensureSqliteRuntime
and ensureTrayRuntime failures. When self-heal failed (e.g. npm EACCES,
network timeout), the server would crash later with cryptic 'No SQLite
driver available' instead of an actionable diagnostic.

Now logs '[sqlite-runtime] self-heal failed: <msg>' and
'[tray-runtime] self-heal failed: <msg>' to stderr so users see root cause.

Fixes GAP-P2-00 from comprehensive gap analysis.

